OL,3,GNEWSAFestival clear-up saw 2.8 tonnes
OL,4,Aof waste collected
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers at this year's Reading
OL,7,FFestival collected 2.8 tonnes of waste
OL,8,Fand repaired 264 items.
OL,10,FThe event saw about 100,000 people
OL,11,Fattend the festival in Richfield Avenue
OL,12,Fand it was followed by a major clean-up
OL,13,Foperation.
OL,15,FLife's a Beach, one of the groups
OL,16,Finvolved, collected 2.8 tonnes of
OL,17,Frecycling and waste material, according
OL,18,Fto the Local Democracy Reporting
OL,19,FService.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
