OL,3,GNEWSAFestival clear-up saw 2.8 tonnes
OL,4,Aof waste collected
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganiser Festival Republic said
OL,7,Ftwo-thirds of tents were taken home in
OL,8,F2025, and its goal was that none were
OL,9,Fleft behind after the event.
